OL,3,GNEWSATown council has 'reservations'
OL,4,Aover new mural design
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council has expressed
OL,7,Freservations about the designs for a
OL,8,Flarge mural planned for a shopping
OL,9,Fprecinct.
OL,11,FThe artwork, proposed for Bury Street
OL,12,Fin Abingdon, Oxfordshire, would depict
OL,13,Flocal landmarks including the River
OL,14,FThames and St Helen's Church in vibrant
OL,15,Fcolours.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
