OL,3,GNEWSATown council has 'reservations'
OL,4,Aover new mural design
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbingdon Town Council's Public Art
OL,7,FWorking Group said its concerns
OL,8,Fincluded "the generic nature of the
OL,9,Fdesigns, their bold visual impact and
OL,10,Fwhether they are appropriate for
OL,11,FAbingdon's character as a historic
OL,12,Fmarket town".
OL,14,FResidents are now being asked for their
OL,15,Fviews on the design, size and location
OL,16,Fof the artwork ahead of a final
OL,17,Fdecision by Vale of White Horse
OL,18,FDistrict Council. The consultation
OL,19,Fcloses on 10 December.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
